WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.562
Counting stock should not take over your day.

00:00:04.055 --> 00:00:07.255
Friendly one two three puts your business in five colors.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.775
Green is healthy.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.150
Gold shows opportunity.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.275
Orange needs a check.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.225
Red is urgent.

00:00:17.088 --> 00:00:18.138
Black is sleeping.

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:22.297
Keep stock, sales and commissions together.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:24.682
Try the demo.

00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:26.557
No signup.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.245
No card.
